 <tr><td><tt>RadixHeap</tt>, <tt>DialQueue</tt>, <tt>BucketQueue</tt>
         (monotone, integer keys)</td><td>as <tt>deleteMin()</tt></td>
     <td>\f$ O( 1 ) \f$</td>
     <td>\f$ O( W / B + 2^B W / ( 64 B ) )^* \f$, \f$ O( 1 + W / 64 ) \f$
         and \f$ O( 1 )^* \f$ in a band of width \f$ C < W \f$</td>
     <td>none</td></tr>
